# omnus form endpoints
#
# both forms POST JSON to a same-origin endpoint. leave these unset in local
# development and the forms run in an explicit "local test mode" that
# validates and exercises the whole flow without sending anything anywhere.
#
# in production, point these at your own same-origin handlers, e.g. a
# reverse-proxied route on the host that serves the static build. if they are
# unset in a production build, the forms show a clear "not configured yet"
# message instead of pretending to submit.
#
# demo request endpoint. receives:
#   { "name": string, "email": string, "organization": string, "role": string, "message": string }
# VITE_DEMO_ENDPOINT=/api/demo
#
# waitlist endpoint. receives:
#   { "email": string, "role": string }
# VITE_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=/api/waitlist
